{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/omuhqxslb5svn5rr0kpuhz16dqgj9fl.mp3","text":"嗯？想看我铸造武器吗？可以。小心，别被火星烫到。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/6wys903md86pbewn8vat3qhvtxr10dg.mp3","text":"只有不被使用的武器才不会受损。因此，没有划痕反而是对武器最大的亵渎。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/m8rrao9bxc09pwhuurjlvpb2qb675ow.mp3","text":"现代化的武器装备生产方式让许多传统工匠都失业了，不过跟不上时代的人理应被淘汰，这是规律。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/65/6nitbsgcs2ggqqne6m8w2v10cwdzs4z.mp3","text":"铳械......这种武器会给这个世界带来翻天覆地的变化。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/28yalyo6u73rgefaoj253mfeyn8yp4q.mp3","text":"我的右腿？没什么大不了的，你知道，每个工匠多少都失误过。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/572thozvj6gdouwbjvenfmyarpxkxc5.mp3","text":"感谢你为我提供了展现技艺的机会。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/4g5mhtu1l51b3tszxflcathow3aw1sq.mp3","text":"一些装备上能看到与我一样的名字？不......跟我可没什么关系。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/t5yjxdywzudtviso6hu1kl6o91jr0n7.mp3","text":"以钢铁与黄铜为骨......","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/1xa45sdpkj3wcx711yo85b5ku9lpqsh.mp3","text":"如果这锻锤还能为您尽上几分绵薄之力，我就已经心满意足了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/9m24i7mpcqhytcxp0dhvmkn8y6tnahr.mp3","text":"吧台又开始推新饮品了，今天喝哪款好呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/1gnu25bwofei0mrdc5qmoy8rbs9sdan.mp3","text":"他们都叫我火神。如果需要的话，我可以给你们损毁的武器做维护，另外......我需要的锻冶设备就在这张图纸里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/od02q6opydlah1s5cf0esbrq448d0cu.mp3","text":"唔，有新的灵感。准备好鼓风机，该干活了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/gtrfq0z6fiao66o1t9or8gsg2drw92i.mp3","text":"看来你也能明白，一名优秀工匠对于军事组织的重要性。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/dxk01wd4fadj5trdlgh7jgogm9a8pzx.mp3","text":"维护武器，就是保护生命。你也认同这个观念？看来，我终于找到归宿了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/9i5ys18tqk5mypa69ousrcvlatwrr58.mp3","text":"我希望能......专心工作。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/4ut21bu1i1ti1o2jbwoxg8mr1uhmoop.mp3","text":"队长吗......如果需要的话......不过比起指挥人，我还是更擅长设计和制造武器。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/ryrw0yfctaf3zkeqof0dmjqi9n99gz6.mp3","text":"就不能让我留下好好工作吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/i3jphnos0tlim47ammg863ce5ese6dr.mp3","text":"一群无可救药的家伙......","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/9wv80juv7c19n3f7306jog4f3niw9tw.mp3","text":"哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/8a06lqcao6yu7bdj5xta648tg584uxr.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/3vx9m505vqd4ooxlj4cw6emsg5nbg1r.mp3","text":"好的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/i6ql1u81j2vqua6mcoireqz81zg42vp.mp3","text":"一切正常。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/6q1mfvicgly50ltgheptwqozm9bx4k7.mp3","text":"武装起来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/ttdnaaw9ck7kbjrv3wwb4gpp8zjccy5.mp3","text":"暴怒的烈焰啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/53/hejlarep2sk0yhwehu8jg01enr85qx5.mp3","text":"我不需要治疗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/2kg31q7hh6s7ts51pkhkmhuvqysiibu.mp3","text":"下一击，就破坏掉你的武器！","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/c3jl0vyzm3xqb14is60hk96bbm8of86.mp3","text":"捡到敌人的装备就让我看看，我想知道现在他们都在做些什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/0iay01ngt0dl9ry1oasprzhzu7cnkb6.mp3","text":"意料之中的胜利！这就是为什么人需要依靠好的装备。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/obzc0n9c99ushod2o5r56w6075tznr5.mp3","text":"把各自装备的破损情况提交给我，回去之后我会统一检修。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/tvpqdb0ch3yf7he0bv2wwdboc8xjg9l.mp3","text":"是我技艺不精......","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/qfp3tg8od7irgeb4730sald157abhqn.mp3","text":"这里有熔炉吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/ergl3a1rzidx43zkjx2w2f37fhx9l4a.mp3","text":"啊啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/6sxyk3y2yhtac1fldvw9pz6k6hstde8.mp3","text":"想要什么好装备了吗？我可以试着帮你做出来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/hrnwr5q2svndlphhwlgcmg3uprgkusz.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/q9fksn5kqqf8hfso9hsy38m7rsd8k8n.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。稍等一下，我正在处理锻炉，干我们这行的有个习惯，新年燃起的炉火一定要旺盛，只有这样，打造出的装备才会好用。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/8tmeop1raxl9qmgkdcauoou27inr8jg.mp3","text":"早安，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_163_hpsts/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/81nll1r7kkvmf5lie4bxgg9wdghpwu0.mp3","text":"嗯？想看我铸造武器吗？可以。小心，别被火星烫到。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/r7pr1nztnpz0wbzrtobkqu77sz9sd8t.mp3","text":"只有不被使用的武器才不会受损。因此，没有划痕反而是对武器最大的亵渎。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/qs6czkyifc85k5ozlmua7wqfm91gctr.mp3","text":"现代化的武器装备生产方式让许多传统工匠都失业了，不过跟不上时代的人理应被淘汰，这是规律。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/7smpvrmarac3kaj56sdr09z3noc9kcv.mp3","text":"铳械......这种武器会给这个世界带来翻天覆地的变化。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/m4oaszzlmmpb6axqf75wtgxmr715sou.mp3","text":"我的右腿？没什么大不了的，你知道，每个工匠多少都失误过。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/rd191fsvdf4amdlnml46s2j2a5esx8n.mp3","text":"感谢你为我提供了展现技艺的机会。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/4rmrd6fx13m7pinjr0pobnm23ptw63v.mp3","text":"一些装备上能看到与我一样的名字？不......跟我可没什么关系。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/k2ljfp07o81i8t21d8tpkw9cetpikpd.mp3","text":"以钢铁与黄铜为骨......","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/11/ar4ktg9u5pd8zg9kd4b0ye3sacodhvz.mp3","text":"如果这锻锤还能为您尽上几分绵薄之力，我就已经心满意足了。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/pq9o32q73wyp1vqr7alymdxo2unw1mb.mp3","text":"吧台又开始推新饮品了，今天喝哪款好呢。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/ksvthwnc49pa07t9v3iarlpoi9gviqg.mp3","text":"他们都叫我火神。如果需要的话，我可以给你们损毁的武器做维护，另外......我需要的锻冶设备就在这张图纸里。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/7srarqif3asmpp0afy8akizfe0ozmp0.mp3","text":"唔，有新的灵感。准备好鼓风机，该干活了。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/gvfssykoyq4w196k6ucwk8z6tdh0b80.mp3","text":"看来你也能明白，一名优秀工匠对于军事组织的重要性。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/l8y0egtmzgctmkdbt98vcikyphw0q8b.mp3","text":"维护武器，就是保护生命。你也认同这个观念？看来，我终于找到归宿了。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/6up29nsc80y01q1zsucc3iimtv28xi2.mp3","text":"我希望能......专心工作。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/rlljni9bz8tl5muja70r53x2bdhqn1m.mp3","text":"队长吗......如果需要的话......不过比起指挥人，我还是更擅长设计和制造武器。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/j73318lfcu1dnesog880c2nv37h4di9.mp3","text":"就不能让我留下好好工作吗？","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/csvzwyi56gkfr6pjkwplifqif8trix6.mp3","text":"一群无可救药的家伙......","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/r3xqw2lxt2njhq0h7g56vz69jh96997.mp3","text":"哦。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/tob2sh0r5nla288pdx4ms7toqe6cdn7.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/djrh51rz75skt8p441437ewwve9mfen.mp3","text":"好的......","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/my9pt53dsd12h8kyqza7v7ahgt5rba1.mp3","text":"一切正常。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/d0rxpvzp3dn2wmng13ldt69o2rvrnta.mp3","text":"武装起来。","alt":"voice/char_163_hpsts/cn_025.m